        }
      }
    },
    "OpenDuet needs a chat model with tools from a provider that has a key." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenDuet 需要一个支持工具的聊天模型，而且它的服务商已经填了密钥。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenDuet needs a model to reply. Add a provider with its key, then pick its models." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenDuet 需要一个模型才能回复。先添加服务商并填好密钥，再挑选它的模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenDuet needs a model to think with. Add a provider and its API key; you pick which of its models to use." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenDuet 需要一个模型来思考。添加一个服务商和它的 API 密钥，再由你挑选用哪些模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenDuet notices what needs doing, does it\nin the background, and reaches out when it needs you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenDuet 会留意需要做的事，在后台完成，需要你时再来找你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenDuet only uses this channel's memory here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在这里，OpenDuet 只用这个频道自己的记忆。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenDuet pauses when something looks unsafe, lets you set the permissions, and keeps your messages and data private." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "OpenDuet 遇到不安全的情况会暂停，权限由你设定，你的消息和数据保持私密。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "OpenDuet reads the feed from its own site." : {
